The kernel modules under camera/ are licensed separately under GPL-2.0, as
required for Linux kernel code:

  camera/gc2607/gc2607.c
      GalaxyCore GC2607 V4L2 sensor driver.
      Derived from https://github.com/abbood/gc2607-v4l2-driver,
      itself based on the GC2145 driver and the Ingenic T41 driver.
      SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0

  camera/ipu-bridge-gc2607/
      Build packaging that patches the kernel's own drivers/media/pci/intel/
      ipu-bridge.c (GPL-2.0, Linux kernel contributors) to add a GC2607
      sensor entry. The patched source is fetched at build time and is not
      redistributed here.
